Read AGENTS.md and docs/VERIFICATION.md before integration or workflow changes.
Find the workflow's business guide through docs/WORKFLOWS.md. Establish its
app-owned contract, use discovered FetchSandbox MCP schemas and isolated twins,
measure the actual saved business effects, fix narrowly and rerun. Preserve
failed/blocked/unmeasured checks; report receipt, version and remaining limits.
